Subject: [PATCH 13/15] feat(surface-placement-audit): --cache DIR keeps CT
 chunks on disk

ChunkCache wraps the volume and stores each native chunk it reads as a .npy
keyed by shape, chunking and dtype, so reruns and further surfaces on the same
remote volume read from disk. Two tests: cached slices equal direct reads
across chunk boundaries and a second pass fetches nothing; the flag leaves the
audit result unchanged.
---
 vesuvius/docs/surface-placement-audit.md      |  4 ++
 .../image_proc/run/surface_placement_audit.py | 65 +++++++++++++++++++
